            ],
            "description": "# Sat counter\n\nGiven a BTC UTXO, finds any sats that are not common, early, or from the pizza transaction and gives the number of sats\nbefore that for the purposes of isolating the sat.\n\n## Usage\n\n`count-sats URL`\n\nWhere the url is the url to the output on ordinals.com\n\ne.g. `count-sats https://ordinals.com/output/7a0e220389d111cc227b128a0a51fd79ebd483c59780aca14f50e4454b3edf55:0`\n\nMake sure the ordinals.com page shows sat ranges in the output, otherwise this will fail\n",
